A guard appears. "Who are you ? Follow me."
Well, I would, but the stupid guard is just standing there. 
I #chat to the guard. "Please follow me." Gah!
I take one step backwards... without remembering that
the guard considers this as an escape attempt ! So, he then
proceeds to readjust my body's dimensions to a point where
life is no longer an option. Why didn't the guard move ? 

1) Because I picked up gold and dropped it before he appeared.
He made no accusations about that. This would be a bug.

2) A monster was standing behind the guard... a really slow, 
undetectable (to my current charecter) monster.
Darn, this occurred to me only after the death, so I can't be sure.


